# Grand Pearl Marquee backend environment template
#
# The backend runs from the `server/` directory and reads its
# configuration from `server/.env`. This root-level `.env` file is
# NOT used by the backend.
#
# To configure the backend:
#   1. cd server
#   2. cp .env.example .env
#   3. Fill in your values in server/.env
#
# The authoritative backend template is server/.env.example.
